{
	chapter.0FE09B0E6D6E546C.title: "Important Knowledge"
	chapter.1E6A3D0CA37A458C.title: "Difficulty Settings"
	chapter_group.70D7A837ABBF9B5A.title: "Chapter I"
	chapter_group.74285A0F7572AEFD.title: "Get Started"
	file.0000000000000001.title: "TerraFirmaMagica"
	quest.13C130AFA3DFB075.quest_desc: ["If you managing the extenguishing of torches or candles, you will find line 153 and line 160 ways to increase their duration.\\n\\nThis settings are found in the tfc-server.toml file."]
	quest.1FA179DE079FC74A.quest_desc: ["If TerraFirmaMagica can't be played on peaceful due to the heavy requirement on mob drops, you can still decide between Easy/Normal/Hard or even if you feel crazy enough Hardcore.\\n\\nEasy removes any buffs to the mods, so the difficulty should be kept at its minimum, allowing you after a difficult early game to overpowered easily every mobs.\\n\\nNormal and Hard will behave the same with just the added difficulty. Though Hard mode will also spawn very rarely some smaller world boss that you will be wise to evade early on."]
	quest.1FA179DE079FC74A.quest_subtitle: "Anything outside of peaceful"
	quest.1FA179DE079FC74A.title: "Choosing Difficulty"
	quest.239AE4C6BCB2D0ED.quest_desc: ["TerraFirmaCraft comes with a really extensive list of setting that you will be able to find in the config folder under the name of tfc-server.toml\\n\\nYou should feel free to customize anything you want so you can get the best experience but remember that the modpack had been thought with specific settings in mind and that you could break balance and progression by modifying these."]
	quest.239AE4C6BCB2D0ED.quest_subtitle: "Custom as much as you want"
	quest.239AE4C6BCB2D0ED.title: "TerraFirmaCraft Settings"
	quest.2E5B8D55A0AED2F6.quest_subtitle: "Basic Knowledge"
	quest.333DBE691929D7F4.title: "Modular Difficulty"
	quest.52A89F3328A494E2.quest_desc: ["If you think food is spoiling too fast or if you are playing on a server. You may want to modify the decay rate of food. Before modifying it, you should know that the calendar on which food decay is based only progress if there is players on the server. So if you are on a server but only play with friends at the same time. You may not feel the need to slow the process of food roting.\\n\\nYou have two ways to change this setting, the first is line 899 of the config file so you can modify every foods decay rate.\\n\\nThe other way is line 831 and allow you to modify the strenght of each preservation method. Which could be seen a more balanced method if that's what you would like to do."]
	quest.52A89F3328A494E2.quest_subtitle: "tfc-server.toml"
	quest.5AA4DB7B7BA516A4.quest_desc: ["If for roleplaying reason or even increased difficulty, you feel like modifying the calendar. You got commands to do it right ingame.\\n\\n/time set MonthLength *days*\\n/time set DayLength *minutes*\\n\\nYou should be cautious of one thing though: modifying your calendar could have impact on your gameplay. Some mobs could spawn less frequently and agriculture could become really difficult. So if you want to modify this setting, think it through."]
	task.0D5DB332CE75FBD5.title: "Time"
